[[Image:Acidbomb.gif|left]]
This small vial contains a highly reactive acid. When smashed, it will explode into a cloud of acid fog.
<br clear="both" />

Anyone hit by this grenade-like weapon will suffer 10[[d6]] points of [[acid damage]].

==Notes==
* Introduced in the [[Hordes of the Underdark]] [[expansion pack]].
* The grenade will not affect friendly creatures nor neutral [[non-player character]]s who are not associates of [[player character]]s (the "standard" hostile targeting scheme).
* A ranged [[touch attack]] is performed to see if the acid bomb hits; damage is doubled on a [[critical hit]].
* There is additionally "splash damage" of 1 acid damage to each valid target (including the original target) within a {{AoE|huge}} area.

